          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "nd000006",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<section class=\"section\" data-screen-label=\"Security offers\">\n  <div class=\"section__head\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"section__eyebrow\">What we deliver</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section__title\">Six programs, <span class=\"italic\">one methodology</span> &mdash; scoped to your risk, not a template.</h2>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"section__body\">\n      We don&rsquo;t sell platforms. We write the documentation, run the workshops, build the evidence, and sit beside your team in the audit room.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"offers\">\n    <div class=\"offer\">\n      <div class=\"offer__num\">01 &middot; Assessment</div>\n      <h3 class=\"offer__title\">Gap &amp; maturity assessment</h3>\n      <p class=\"offer__body\">A structured, four-week review against ISO 27001:2022 and your sector&rsquo;s baseline. Findings, remediation plan, and effort estimate.</p>\n      <ul class=\"offer__list\">\n        <li>Interviews &amp; evidence walk</li>\n        <li>Control-by-control scoring</li>\n        <li>Prioritized 12-month plan</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"offer\">\n      <div class=\"offer__num\">02 &middot; ISMS</div>\n      <h3 class=\"offer__title\">ISO 27001 implementation</h3>\n      <p class=\"offer__body\">End-to-end program: scope, risk methodology, SoA, Annex A controls, internal audit, and management review &mdash; through Stage 2 certification.</p>\n      <ul class=\"offer__list\">\n        <li>Scope statement &amp; context</li>\n        <li>Risk register &amp; treatment plan</li>\n        <li>Certification shepherding</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"offer\">\n      <div class=\"offer__num\">03 &middot; GRC</div>\n      <h3 class=\"offer__title\">GRC program build</h3>\n      <p class=\"offer__body\">Policy library, control matrix, and evidence workflows in your GRC tool of choice &mdash; Vanta, Drata, or a properly-configured Odoo.</p>\n      <ul class=\"offer__list\">\n        <li>22 core policies &middot; EN/FR</li>\n        <li>Control-to-evidence mapping</li>\n        <li>Tool selection &amp; setup</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"offer\">\n      <div class=\"offer__num\">04 &middot; Risk</div>\n      <h3 class=\"offer__title\">Enterprise risk management</h3>\n      <p class=\"offer__body\">A risk register your board will read. Quantitative where we can (FAIR), qualitative where we must, reviewed on a quarterly cadence.</p>\n      <ul class=\"offer__list\">\n        <li>Risk taxonomy &middot; tolerance</li>\n        <li>Quarterly risk committee</li>\n        <li>Third-party &amp; vendor risk</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"offer\">\n      <div class=\"offer__num\">05 &middot; vCISO</div>\n      <h3 class=\"offer__title\">Fractional CISO</h3>\n      <p class=\"offer__body\">A senior security leader on your exec team for 4&ndash;10 days a month. Strategy, board reporting, incident response, and vendor reviews.</p>\n      <ul class=\"offer__list\">\n        <li>Board &amp; exec reporting</li>\n        <li>Incident-response lead</li>\n        <li>Audit &amp; questionnaire owner</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"offer\">\n      <div class=\"offer__num\">06 &middot; Awareness</div>\n      <h3 class=\"offer__title\">Security awareness &amp; training</h3>\n      <p class=\"offer__body\">Programs your team completes on purpose &mdash; scenario-driven, bilingual, reinforced with phishing exercises that match your threat model.</p>\n      <ul class=\"offer__list\">\n        <li>All-staff curriculum &middot; EN/FR</li>\n        <li>Role-based modules &middot; dev / finance</li>\n        <li>Phishing cadence &amp; reporting</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
              },
              "elements": [],
              "widgetType": "html"
            }
          ],
          "isInner": false
        }
      ],
