              "id": "nd000009",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<section class=\"iso\" id=\"iso\" data-screen-label=\"ISO timeline\">\n  <div class=\"iso__inner\">\n    <div class=\"iso__head\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"iso__eyebrow\">ISO 27001:2022 &middot; the path</div>\n        <h2 class=\"iso__title\">From gap assessment to certificate, <span class=\"italic\">in twelve months.</span></h2>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"iso__body\">\n        A predictable cadence. Each phase has a written deliverable, a signed-off exit criterion, and a clear owner on your side. No surprises at the audit.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"timeline\">\n      <div class=\"tstep done\">\n        <div class=\"tstep__marker\">01</div>\n        <div class=\"tstep__phase\">Month 1</div>\n        <h4 class=\"tstep__title\">Gap &amp; scope</h4>\n        <p class=\"tstep__body\">ISMS scope statement, stakeholder map, context of the organization, interested parties.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tstep done\">\n        <div class=\"tstep__marker\">02</div>\n        <div class=\"tstep__phase\">Month 2</div>\n        <h4 class=\"tstep__title\">Risk register</h4>\n        <p class=\"tstep__body\">Risk methodology, asset inventory, threat library, scored register with treatment plan.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tstep done\">\n        <div class=\"tstep__marker\">03</div>\n        <div class=\"tstep__phase\">Month 3</div>\n        <h4 class=\"tstep__title\">SoA &amp; policy</h4>\n        <p class=\"tstep__body\">Statement of Applicability, 22 core policies, standards and procedures &mdash; all signed off.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tstep active\">\n        <div class=\"tstep__marker\">04</div>\n        <div class=\"tstep__phase\">Months 4&ndash;8</div>\n        <h4 class=\"tstep__title\">Control rollout</h4>\n        <p class=\"tstep__body\">93 Annex A controls implemented with owners, cadence, and evidence workflows. You are here.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tstep\">\n        <div class=\"tstep__marker\">05</div>\n        <div class=\"tstep__phase\">Months 9&ndash;10</div>\n        <h4 class=\"tstep__title\">Internal audit</h4>\n        <p class=\"tstep__body\">Independent internal audit, nonconformity register, management review, corrective action.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tstep\">\n        <div class=\"tstep__marker\">06</div>\n        <div class=\"tstep__phase\">Months 11&ndash;12</div>\n        <h4 class=\"tstep__title\">Certification</h4>\n        <p class=\"tstep__body\">Stage 1 readiness audit, Stage 2 certification audit, closing NCs, certificate issued.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"iso__metrics\">\n      <div class=\"iso__metric\">\n        <div class=\"k\">93<span class=\"dot\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"l\">Annex A controls &middot; 2022</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"iso__metric\">\n        <div class=\"k\">22</div>\n        <div class=\"l\">Core policies &middot; bilingual</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"iso__metric\">\n        <div class=\"k\">12<span class=\"unit\">mo</span></div>\n        <div class=\"l\">Typical path to cert</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"iso__metric\">\n        <div class=\"k\">100<span class=\"unit\">%</span></div>\n        <div class=\"l\">First-attempt Stage 2 pass</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
              },
              "elements": [],
              "widgetType": "html"
            }
