              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<section class=\"faq\" data-screen-label=\"Security FAQ\">\n  <div class=\"faq__grid\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"section__eyebrow\">Common questions</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section__title\" style=\"max-width: 400px;\">Before you <span class=\"italic\">book.</span></h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"faq__list\">\n      <div class=\"faq__item\">\n        <h3 class=\"faq__q\">How long does ISO 27001 certification really take?</h3>\n        <span class=\"faq__plus\">+</span>\n        <p class=\"faq__a\">Twelve months is typical for a team of 20&ndash;200 starting from scratch. Smaller or better-organized teams can do it in 8&ndash;9. We publish a week-by-week plan before we start billing.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq__item\">\n        <h3 class=\"faq__q\">Can we do ISO 27001 and SOC 2 Type II in parallel?</h3>\n        <span class=\"faq__plus\">+</span>\n        <p class=\"faq__a\">Yes, and we usually recommend it. About 85% of the work overlaps. We write one policy set, one control matrix, and one evidence workflow &mdash; then satisfy both audits from the same system.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq__item\">\n        <h3 class=\"faq__q\">Do you bring a GRC tool or use ours?</h3>\n        <span class=\"faq__plus\">+</span>\n        <p class=\"faq__a\">Either. We&rsquo;re tool-agnostic: Vanta, Drata, Tugboat Logic, Sprinto, or a well-configured Odoo for clients who prefer to keep everything in one system. We&rsquo;ll recommend based on scale and budget.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq__item\">\n        <h3 class=\"faq__q\">What does the engagement cost?</h3>\n        <span class=\"faq__plus\">+</span>\n        <p class=\"faq__a\">Gap assessments start at $12,000 CAD. Full ISO 27001 implementations range $85k&ndash;$180k depending on scope, team size, and whether a vCISO is included. We send a fixed-fee proposal after the assessment.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq__item\">\n        <h3 class=\"faq__q\">Do you handle Qu&eacute;bec Law 25 compliance?</h3>\n        <span class=\"faq__plus\">+</span>\n        <p class=\"faq__a\">Yes. Law 25 is bundled into our ISMS work for Qu&eacute;bec clients at no extra cost &mdash; the policies, DPIAs, breach-response procedures, and consent flows map directly onto ISO 27001 Annex A.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq__item\">\n        <h3 class=\"faq__q\">Can you be our certification body?</h3>\n        <span class=\"faq__plus\">+</span>\n        <p class=\"faq__a\">No &mdash; by design. A certification body cannot also be your implementation partner. We prepare you and recommend three accredited CBs (Schellman, BSI, ISO-based in Canada) that have worked well for our clients.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
              },
              "elements": [],
              "widgetType": "html"
            }
          ],
          "isInner": false
        }
      ],
